      "id": "q1",
      "type": "explain",
      "q": "Why should an emergency fund not be held in stocks?",
      "a": "Stock prices can fall at the same time as job losses, forcing a sale at a loss.",
      "anchor": "#mechanism-how-much-and-where",
      "origin": "author"
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "compare",
      "q": "How does the target differ for a two-income household and a self-employed person?",
      "a": "About 3 months versus 9 to 12 months, because income risk is higher for the self-employed.",
      "anchor": "#mechanism-how-much-and-where",
